00:19:45,824 --> 00:19:49,824
We're here to party and that's Captain's orders.

269
00:19:54,824 --> 00:19:55,824
Who the heck are you?

270
00:19:58,824 --> 00:19:59,824
Get back, Luffy!

271
00:19:59,824 --> 00:20:01,824
He's one of the seven warlords of the sea!

272
00:20:01,824 --> 00:20:04,824
He is? How do you guys know that?

273
00:20:06,824 --> 00:20:09,824
Luffy, don't let that attack hit you! It's a shockwave!

274
00:20:09,824 --> 00:20:11,824
What?

275
00:20:18,824 --> 00:20:19,824
Damn!

276
00:20:19,824 --> 00:20:20,824
What is that?

277
00:20:20,824 --> 00:20:22,824
Great! So he can do this crap too?

278
00:20:23,824 --> 00:20:26,824
Hey! You lied! That wasn't a shockwave!

279
00:20:27,824 --> 00:20:29,824
That was... a beam!

280
00:20:30,824 --> 00:20:33,824
You're gonna be impressed straight to your grave!

281
00:20:33,824 --> 00:20:38,824
Bartholomew Kuma, why are you here?

282
00:20:39,824 --> 00:20:40,824
That bastard!

283
00:20:41,824 --> 00:20:42,824
Hey, I remember him now!

284
00:20:42,824 --> 00:20:44,824
He's the guy that showed up at Thriller Bark I never fought!

285
00:20:45,824 --> 00:20:46,824
That's right, the very same!

286
00:20:47,824 --> 00:20:50,824
Things got pretty dicey when he started shooting at us with shockwaves from the paws on his hands!

287
00:20:51,824 --> 00:20:52,824
We barely made it out alive!

288
00:20:54,824 --> 00:20:57,824
The fact that we are still alive is probably the reason he came back!

289
00:20:57,824 --> 00:21:07,824
In other words, we got lucky last time, but he's here to finish the job!

290
00:21:08,824 --> 00:21:12,824
Sure, that's one way to look at it, but I call this payback time!

291
00:21:13,824 --> 00:21:14,824
You dead?

292
00:21:14,824 --> 00:21:15,824
You dead?

293
00:21:22,824 --> 00:21:23,824
You got him!

294
00:21:24,824 --> 00:21:27,824
Not exactly. He's down, but he ain't out.

295
00:21:33,824 --> 00:21:34,824
Alright, second gear!

296
00:21:35,824 --> 00:21:37,824
We know he's strong, no question!

297
00:21:38,824 --> 00:21:40,824
So let's go all out from the start!

298
00:21:45,824 --> 00:21:47,824
I'll be on the boat!

299
00:21:51,824 --> 00:21:52,824
Something's off here.

300
00:21:53,824 --> 00:21:55,824
He seems different from the last time we met.

301
00:22:02,824 --> 00:22:03,824
Or am I crazy?

302
00:22:11,824 --> 00:22:12,824
Let's go!

303
00:22:14,824 --> 00:22:15,824
Let's go!

304
00:22:24,824 --> 00:22:25,824
What's taking so long?

305
00:22:26,824 --> 00:22:27,824
The warship should have been here by now.

306
00:22:31,824 --> 00:22:33,824
Why hasn't Uncle Kizaru contacted me yet?

307
00:22:41,824 --> 00:22:42,824
It's chaos already.

308
00:22:45,824 --> 00:22:46,824
He'd better hurry.

309
00:22:46,824 --> 00:22:57,824
Or there won't be any rookies left.

310
00:22:58,824 --> 00:22:59,824
Not at this rate.

311
00:22:59,824 --> 00:23:00,684
At this rate.

312
00:23:07,184 --> 00:23:10,164
You met this warlord guy before, but this time he's different?

313
00:23:10,684 --> 00:23:14,144
Yeah, the real one had different powers and he was a lot more talkative.

314
00:23:14,404 --> 00:23:15,804
That's not what I want to hear.

315
00:23:16,064 --> 00:23:19,644
This guy's damn near invincible and you're telling me there's two of him?

316
00:23:19,704 --> 00:23:21,084
Wait, so this one's a fake?

317
00:23:21,664 --> 00:23:23,164
On the next, One Piece.

318
00:23:23,944 --> 00:23:24,424
Overwhelming.

319
00:23:24,744 --> 00:23:27,064
The Navy's fighting weapons, the pacifistas.

320
00:23:27,624 --> 00:23:29,384
I'm gonna be king of the pirates.

321
00:23:29,824 --> 00:23:31,824
I'm gonna be king of the pirates.

